        "summary": "Readiness \u2014 are the data artefacts usable?",
        "description": "Readiness deliberately reports DEGRADED rather than failing outright when the\nhistory panel is missing: forecasts and backtests still work without it, and\na partially-useful API beats a dead one during a demo.",
        "operationId": "ready_api_v1_ready_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
